{
  "id": "authors-note",
  "kind": "frontmatter",
  "label": "Author's Note",
  "title": "NOTE FROM THE AUTHOR",
  "shortTitle": "Authors Note",
  "file": "chapters/05-authors-note.json",
  "index": 5,
  "sourceRange": [
    91,
    124
  ],
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "(Don’t read this for comfort — read it for recognition) ",
          "bold": true
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 92
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This book was never written to tell you how to move on. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 93
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because nothing here assumes you are stuck because of a person. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 94
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It assumes something more uncomfortable… "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 95
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "that you might be stuck because of a system inside your mind that keeps re"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 96
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "running unfinished meaning. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 97
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "There is no “someone” at the center of this. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 98
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "There is a loop. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 99
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And that loop is intelligent enough to disguise itself as love… memory… loss… "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 100
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "and even healing. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 101
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "If you read this book casually… "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 102
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "you will call it emotional writing. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 103
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But if you read it completely… "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 104
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "you will notice something else: "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 105
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "you were not living events… you were reinterpreting them again and again "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 106
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "until they felt real enough to suffer from. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 107
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This book does not offer closure. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 108
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because closure is just another form of continuation when the mind refuses to "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 109
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "drop the pattern. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 110
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It only does one thing… "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 111
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "it exposes repetition. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 112
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And repetition, once seen clearly, stops feeling like emotion… "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 113
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "and starts feeling like structure. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 114
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "That is where everything changes. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 115
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not because something ends… "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 116
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "but because something stops being believed in the same way. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 117
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And at that point, two sentences stop being opposites"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 118
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“I can’t move on” "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 119
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“I’m moving on” "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 120
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because both were never about movement. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 121
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "They were about how deeply the loop was still active. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 122
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "— Lalit.R.Mishra"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 123,
      "role": "chapter-end"
    }
  ],
